{"unit_id":"CWNU-Open-Source-Community__dsh-webgate#card-zh","repo":"CWNU-Open-Source-Community/dsh-webgate","commit":"4d69e43b7e1f9073c9c11ce068a24e330cb46a1c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-webgate 是 DSH 网页端远程访问插件，适合希望在手机或其他设备上继续使用本机 DSH 会话的用户。它通过 bundle 配置局域网监听，并在设置页展示访问地址和二维码；还可按配置启动 cloudflared 快速隧道或 frp 客户端。插件提供登录门户选项，并为远程页面注入局域网信息、UUID 兼容代码和最近会话选择。需要运行 DSH web；隧道程序及服务器配置由使用者提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:8-31","lib/index.js:402-529","lib/client.js:62-150","lib/portal.js:71-192"]}
{"unit_id":"CWNU-Open-Source-Community__dsh-webgate#card-en","repo":"CWNU-Open-Source-Community/dsh-webgate","commit":"4d69e43b7e1f9073c9c11ce068a24e330cb46a1c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-webgate lets phones access a local DSH web interface. It enables LAN binding and shows addresses and QR codes in Settings. Optional cloudflared or frp tunnels provide remote access; a password portal can gate sessions. It injects LAN details and suggests a recent session in served pages.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:8-31","lib/index.js:402-529","lib/client.js:62-150","lib/portal.js:71-192"]}
